{
 "encounter_id": "00959",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR",
  "person_3": "CAREGIVER"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Morning, doctor. It's his cough, you see. Mr Whitfield, Alan, has had this dry cough for three weeks, ever since he started the new blood pressure tablet. I'm Gemma, his carer."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thank you, Gemma. Alan, is it a dry cough?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Dry as a bone. Tickly. Right at the back of my throat."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "It's worse at night, and he's up half the night coughing. We've both been up."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any fever?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No fever."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Short of breath?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, I'm not breathless. Just coughing."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Coughing up blood?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No blood, no."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Which tablet is it, Gemma?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Lisinopril, 10 mg, once a day. Started three weeks ago."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thank you. Any allergies, Alan?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Penicillin. A rash."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Medical history?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "High blood pressure, obviously. And arthritis in my hips."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me check you. Pulse 76, blood pressure 138 over 84, temperature 36.6, oxygen 97 percent, breathing 16, weight 79 kilos.",
   "pause": 15.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Is that all right? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "All good. Take some deep breaths for me, Alan.",
   "pause": 10.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "In and out. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Your chest is clear on both sides, no wheeze, no crackles."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "That's good. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It sounds as if the cough is coming from the lisinopril. It's a known side effect of that group of tablets."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Really? I thought it was a cold. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It can last for weeks, and it can come on after starting. I'm not going to change anything this minute, though. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Why not? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to rule out other causes first. I'd like to arrange a chest X-ray, and some blood tests."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Today? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "This week. I'll think about changing the tablet once I have the X-ray results. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Will the cough go away? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Usually it settles within a few weeks once the tablet is changed. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "That's a relief. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "In the meantime, a spoonful of honey before bed can help soothe the tickle."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "I'll get some honey. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to see you again in two weeks."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Two weeks. Thank you, doctor. ~"
  }
 ],
